---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/07-04/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/07-04/interactions.json';
import {fixtures} from '../../../../lib/equipment/07-04/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/07-04/',doc='https://zakazky.czu.cz/document_audit_50995/796_priloha-c-1-kupni-smlouva_podepsana_komplet_casove-razitko-pdf';
const display=x=>typeof x==='string'?x:Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="ECHO CellCyte Gen 2 documentary view" subtitle="" description="Inspect the unpowered CellCyte2 exterior and compare fixed synthetic geometry images away from the instrument." wide={true}>
<article id="cc2" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/07-04/">← Equipment 07-04</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#cc2-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">07-04 / ECHO CellCyte Gen 2 / Documentary shell and static geometry images</p><h2>ECHO CellCyte Gen 2</h2><p>Inspect the dormant outer frame, then read a rectangle’s dimensions on a separate pre-existing synthetic image. The complete rectangle is 10 × 5.6 mm. The clipped example withholds dimensions rather than treating the visible fragment as the original shape.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the dormant frame</h3><div id="cc2-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Exterior','Desk'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="cc2-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div><canvas id="cc2-model" aria-label="Orbitable inert CellCyte2 frame with separate static image desk"></canvas><p id="cc2-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">Use the three detached desk keys to pick complete, clipped or blank, from left to right. Nothing on the instrument moves or operates. Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Choose a locked image</h3><div class="e-fields"><label>Static image<select id="cc2-frame">{Object.entries(fixtures).map(([k,v])=><option value={k}>{v.label}</option>)}</select></label></div><div class="e-row"><button id="cc2-reset" type="button">Restore complete</button><button id="cc2-png" class="e-run" disabled>Export pixels PNG</button><button id="cc2-json" disabled>Export measurement JSON</button></div><p id="cc2-status" role="status">No frame read.</p><p id="cc2-result" role="status">No readout.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Compare static geometry</h3><div class="image-overlay"><canvas id="cc2-raster" width="128" height="96" aria-label="Locked synthetic image of an inert rectangle or blank fixture"></canvas><svg id="cc2-outline" viewBox="0 0 128 96" aria-hidden="true"><rect id="cc2-bounds" fill="none" stroke="#81c489" stroke-width="1.4" display="none"/></svg></div>
<p>Raster calibration is 0.25 mm per X pixel and 0.20 mm per Y pixel. Readout counts bright columns, rows and pixels. A visible shape touching an image boundary is incomplete; a blank image has no shape. Both return null dimensions. The PNG is unannotated; JSON contains pixels and complete provenance. <a href={a+'example-metadata.json'}>Example metadata</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Documentary geometry</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original CellCyte Gen 2 external frame with separate image desk"/><figcaption>Original exterior following the <a href={doc+'#page=12'}>ECHO front photograph, procurement attachment p. 12</a>. The detached desk is invented.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original CellCyte Gen 2 three-quarter external silhouette"/><figcaption>Original open-frame outline informed by the <a href={doc+'#page=13'}>dimensioned ECHO perspective, p. 13</a>. The fixed blank deck has no holders or contents.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Published envelope</th><th>Parsed metric GLB</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Width × depth × height</td><td>495.3 × 406.4 × 320.04 mm</td><td>495.3 × 406.4 × 320.04 mm; coordinate bounds, not a physical measurement.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Silhouette, stand partitions and surface details are original approximations. No living material, handling, instrument settings, acquisition, camera model, time series, or protocols are provided. The register’s time tracking acceptance is outside this fixed-image pass.</p></section>
<section id="cc2-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'echo-cellcyte-gen2.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/07-04/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#cc2 header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#cc2 h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#cc2 section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#cc2 button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#cc2 button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#cc2-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#cc2-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#cc2 table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#cc2 td,#cc2 th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#cc2 figure{margin:0}#cc2 img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#cc2 caption{text-align:left}#cc2 input,#cc2 select,#cc2 button{min-width:0}#cc2 .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}#cc2 .image-overlay{position:relative;width:min(100%,37rem);aspect-ratio:4/3}#cc2-raster,#cc2-outline{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}#cc2-raster{image-rendering:pixelated;background:#1d1d1d}#cc2-outline{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}</style>
